    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉普蘭德......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝你這段時間以來，“不遺餘力”地幫助我返回龍門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我已經決定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這片土地上有一些不應該就那麼死去的人，他們需要幫助，他們也值得幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你又能做到什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是幾個人描繪出的一點空想，就讓你選擇了與過去不同的答案？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是幾個人描繪出的一點空想，就足以讓我選擇與過去不同的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的事情，並沒有那麼複雜，拉普蘭德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反倒是你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還打算被束縛多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這算什麼，說教？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就當作是過來人的一點建議吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使，我來突圍，背後就交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯，你總是出乎我的意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......哈哈，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "腳步聲與慘叫聲隨著德克薩斯與能天使的離開而逐漸遠離，小巷中逐漸安靜了下來。\n只留下離群的白狼那空洞的笑聲不斷回蕩。\n半晌，她才收起笑聲。\n她將視線轉向一個方向，那不是德克薩斯離開的方向，那是薩盧佐家族駐地的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧比奧之女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親......他......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺好點了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧比奧之女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧比奧之女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法官小姐，你說，為什麼父親會做這種事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧比奧之女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我情願他像以前那樣......就做一個庸庸碌碌的食品安全部部長......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或許你還不能理解，但你的父親是一個偉大的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會派一些人來保護你，待在房間裡，不要亂走，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧比奧之女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就、就算是我也能感覺到，父親這麼做，城裡接下來肯定一片混亂。"
