    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......謝謝你，但我有我的使命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉維妮婭走出房間。\n那一聲銃聲響徹沃爾西尼，似乎連烏雲都因被威懾而退避了幾分，陽光久違地從中鑽出幾縷。\n她曾經將貝納爾多的許諾當成她唯一的目標。\n以至於當她發現貝納爾多違背了諾言時，她一時間不知道該如何自處。\n但是，現在她知道了。\n因為有人告訴她，她並不是在孤軍奮戰。\n而他們的犧牲，比她所做的反抗壯烈百倍。\n和他們相比，自己甚至是幸運的。\n但她並不打算憑藉這份幸運置身事外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧比奧部長，你的犧牲不會白費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她摩挲著手中的法典，腦中仍縈繞著盧比奧日記中提到的幾個名字。\n她或是見過，或是聽說過。\n這是盧比奧留給她最豐厚的遺產。\n而且——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g1_srcstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鵝物流。需要送貨服務嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g10_smallrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿爾貝托閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說貝洛內想要和我談談，才過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼，貝納爾多連露面都不敢了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親有父親的判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您只需要相信，我也可以代表貝洛內家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是，你覺得你能給我一個滿意的解釋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是說，你有把握應對眼下的狀況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想說的正是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "丹布朗？還不到你出來的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，就是現在，老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "丹布朗將手中的武器指向了阿爾貝托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "丹布朗，我恐怕你搞錯了武器指向的對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有搞錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，諸位家族的領袖，瞧瞧你們現在的樣子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們高高在上地坐在這裡，冠冕堂皇地彷彿在談論著所謂的政治，格局，國家，未來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實際上呢？實際上你們在考慮的，是自己的利益。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，我們用暴力攫取了這個時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們為什麼不以此為傲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今時不同往日，為什麼你不明白，丹布朗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們在做的是把時代變成我們想要的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不理解，我只覺得，我們在變得軟弱與愚蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們既不以我們的本能為傲，也不像那些普通人一樣，用和平的方式在尋求和平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣下去，我們會變成什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們不會變成任何東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我們已經不是狼群了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是一群披著人皮的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們的領導者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們沒有變得更文明，你們只是變得更虛偽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來，是我對你太寬容了，丹布朗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡不是你的演講台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有人看清發生了什麼。\n只是眨了一下眼睛，阿爾貝托就出現在了丹布朗的背後。\n而丹布朗的脖子上出現了一道血痕。\n他抱住自己的脖子，瞪大雙眼，無法發出聲音。\n然後，維持著這個姿勢，就這樣緩緩倒下。\n再無聲息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......既然事已至此，我也就不藏了，萊昂圖索少爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我被你的父親說動，決定以你我兩家之力，共同對抗西西里夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而眼下看來，我並不能從你們的行為中看到誠意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人們只知道我阿爾貝托不喜歡下注，卻不知道，我一旦下注，不見到勝利，就決不甘休。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊昂圖索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是成為薩盧佐的附庸，還是死在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有十秒鐘的時間考慮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿爾貝托從腰間掏出一塊古樸的懷錶，開始了萊昂圖索命運的倒計時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g10_smallrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你坐擁暴力，你以教養和自制讓自己不去使用，而我甚至要為你的仁慈而感謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我也不是在責怪你，萊昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你願意去想雨為什麼會下這麼久，已經非常難得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你下意識地把自己和拉維妮婭還有卡拉奇放在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但永遠不要忘記，你和他們不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你真的知道，你就不會站在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊昂圖索以為自己明白他們想說的事情。\n他無法真正成為拉維妮婭的盟友，他永遠是父親的兒子。\n他的出身如此，他無法改變它，而他認為，自己已經做出了最大的努力了。\n難道這樣還不夠嗎？\n可是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g10_smallrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丹布朗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_693_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們沒有變得更文明，你們只是變得更虛偽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到這一刻，他才忽然醒悟過來。\n並不是夠不夠的問題，從一開始他就錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我們沒有變得更文明，我們只是變得更虛偽了。\n我們沒有變得更文明，我們只是變得更虛偽了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "是了，是啊。\n他為什麼會坐在這裡。\n他為什麼依然寄希望於透過家族手段解決問題？\n他明明早已知道答案。\n一直以來，礙於自己的身份和立場，他卻選擇了對這個答案熟視無睹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他過去所行的一切，都只不過是被矯飾的暴力。\n而暴力之中，絕不可能誕生文明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的時間不多了，萊昂圖索少爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的回答是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "發生了什麼事？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首領，次級核心區，次級核心區的分離程式，不知道被誰啟動了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親，這就是你的後手了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，老東西，反應夠快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅塞蒂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊昂，我來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你先走，這裡交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，這就是貝洛內的後手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你們真的想好，要與薩盧佐，與我阿爾貝托為敵了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道你真的想過，和我們成為朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "利益原本可以成為我們之間的紐帶，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我也不討厭你們那股自以為能夠顛覆些什麼的青澀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老東西們總是以為自己能掌控一切，卻從沒想過，自己早已經落後於時代了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來吧，年輕人，讓我試試你們的成色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g1_srcstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊昂圖索知道，作為一個家族的領袖，自己現在應該做的，是返回家族，在這動盪的局勢中，指揮家族，以期取得最大的利益。\n但是，作為一個自以為理解拉維妮婭理想的人，一個曾經在卡拉奇生前見過他諸多行事的人，一個始終在迷茫的人。\n他前有未有地清楚，自己真正應該做的事。\n他無法再欺騙自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，德米特里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他沒有走向家族的方向。\n他知道自己的父親在哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmencommand"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該做的，都做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再過一會，扎羅該察覺到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是時候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿涅塞的獠牙，子月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我等你很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的身邊總是有太多人，我不擅長一次性對付許多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將我作為你的目標並不是一個明智的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿涅塞告訴我，你是剩下的獠牙中，最應該被誅殺的那一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你玩弄著名為權力的東西，想要靠這種無聊的東西來取得勝利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常富有狼之主特色的見解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道，剩下幾頭獠牙的去向嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一頭，如今在一家名為羅德島的公司生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在不久前返回了敘拉古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一頭，自知勝利無望，藏了起來，並早早地教出了一個學生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這兩頭漂泊在外的狼，如今都返回了敘拉古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有一頭，正藏身在荒野之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我，只消坐在這裡，就可以知道她們的動向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並且，如果我的權力再大一些，我還可以按我的意志找到她們，讓我的手下消滅她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是扎羅發現的——權力的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣也算勝利嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是這麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪的是你，阿涅塞的獠牙，你並不打算殺我，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只是有些好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不像是一個邪惡的人，也不像是你所說的一個手握權力的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝納爾多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_685_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你的眼裡，我像是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "子月",
      "speakerId": "avg_4014_lunacu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一頭在自己為自己尋找的死地中安然躺下的野獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g10_smallrestaurant"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那些家族的人都走了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "膽小的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_702_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了......吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，原本還以為他們要打起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "膽小的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_702_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......這具屍體怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐懼的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_696_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我可不想碰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "膽小的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_702_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......總覺得這個人，蠻可憐的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "膽小的服務員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_702_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是這個無名之輩的朋友罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你發現了一件重要的事，我親愛的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以文明之名，行暴力之實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是家族的本質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我們必須承認的一點是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所謂的文明，即便它或許只是一種矯飾，或許只是一種自我的規訓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便我們或許從未真正遠離自己的本能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但發自內心的渴求，與將文明作為粉飾自己的表皮始終是不同的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個國家，這座城市，不會記住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我會記住你，洗車工丹布朗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你與盧比奧一起，戳破了名為家族變遷的謊言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
